<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: "20px 72px", background: "#F5E3BE", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 122, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>原理 · 评估与剪枝怎么做到不爆</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 10 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.62)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginTop: 8 }}>四条优化分别针对「评估成本 / 重复搜索 / 剪枝时机 / 超时安全」</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 510, flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: "100%", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>评估函数不整盘扫描。GomokuEval 只重算被这一步落子影响到的 ≤4 条线（横、竖、两条斜），其余部分的分数直接沿用上一手结果。这一步把每节点的评估开销从 O(棋盘面积) 降到 O(4×线长)。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>Zobrist 哈希加置换表用来吃「重复局面」：不同搜索路径经常走到同一个局面，置换表缓存子树结果，第二次遇到直接取用，不再重搜。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>Killer / History 启发式把历史上容易触发剪枝的强着排到前面，剪枝越早，省下的节点越多。迭代加深则保证在时限内返回「最深的已完成层」，而不是搜到一半被强制砍断、给出一个半成品结果。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>最后是兜底：每个节点都查 deadline，一旦超限就放弃当前分支。宁可搜得浅一点，也绝不烧满时间把界面卡死。</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", background: "rgba(42,33,24,0.94)", borderLeft: "5px solid #B3271E", borderRadius: 6, padding: "10px 20px", marginTop: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(245,227,190,0.92)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>工程取舍：所有优化的前提都是「不能卡界面」——宁可牺牲一点棋力，也不牺牲响应。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 48, flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "space-between" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.55)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>弈趣棋苑 · 项目开发汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.55)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>23 / 64</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>